Z||000003||Devotshka||10-07-2001||08:20 PM||||Cerium Oxide works real well for getting scratches out... quite fast too.  You'll need a buffer of sorts tho, you can't do it by hand (or at least i'd hate to try).<P>That is what glass shops use, and from my experience most of them are quite friendly about handing out half a pound of it for a buck  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>||||reg||1
